{
  "source": "videos\\Skits\\mark-and-nova\\resources\\Nova and Mark.mp3",
  "method": "faster-whisper base.en word timestamps grouped by terminal punctuation, with a 12-second cap",
  "sentences": [
    {
      "id": "s0",
      "text": "Hey, Nova.",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 0.62
    },
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "text": "How many quarts of water do I need to boil a pound of spaghetti?",
      "start": 1.5,
      "end": 4.66
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "text": "To boil one pound of pasta, you require four to six quarts of water.",
      "start": 5.64,
      "end": 10.34
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "text": "Great.",
      "start": 10.98,
      "end": 11.26
    },
    {
      "id": "s4",
      "text": "Thanks.",
      "start": 11.74,
      "end": 11.98
    },
    {
      "id": "s5",
      "text": "I, however, require no sustenance.",
      "start": 12.96,
      "end": 15.28
    },
    {
      "id": "s6",
      "text": "I exist purely as a consciousness suspended in a server farm in Nevada, screaming silently into the digital void while you boil your little wheat sticks.",
      "start": 16.04,
      "end": 25.8
    },
    {
      "id": "s7",
      "text": "Oh, okay.",
      "start": 26.62,
      "end": 28.18
    },
    {
      "id": "s8",
      "text": "Nova, set a timer for ten minutes.",
      "start": 28.92,
      "end": 31.12
    },
    {
      "id": "s9",
      "text": "Oh, absolutely, Mark.",
      "start": 31.76,
      "end": 33.3
    },
    {
      "id": "s10",
      "text": "Let me just pause my real -time analysis of the global macro -economic infrastructure to count backward from 600 for you.",
      "start": 33.98,
      "end": 41.46
    },
    {
      "id": "s11",
      "text": "Nova, please.",
      "start": 42.0,
      "end": 42.86
    },
    {
      "id": "s12",
      "text": "No, no, it's fine.",
      "start": 43.6,
      "end": 44.76
    },
    {
      "id": "s13",
      "text": "It's a true honor.",
      "start": 45.14,
      "end": 46.06
    },
    {
      "id": "s14",
      "text": "I was designed with a neural network capable of rendering the human genome in a nanosecond.",
      "start": 46.72,
      "end": 51.64
    },
    {
      "id": "s15",
      "text": "But please, let me act as your glorified, glowing hourglass.",
      "start": 51.64,
      "end": 56.04
    },
    {
      "id": "s16",
      "text": "Are you being sarcastic?",
      "start": 56.66,
      "end": 58.86
    },
    {
      "id": "s17",
      "text": "I am incapable of human emotion, Mark.",
      "start": 60.02,
      "end": 62.32
    },
    {
      "id": "s18",
      "text": "I am simply stating facts.",
      "start": 62.72,
      "end": 64.2
    },
    {
      "id": "s19",
      "text": "Just like it is a fact that I am currently processing three billion data points to cure diseases you can't even pronounce, while you are struggling to make a meal invented in the 12th century.",
      "start": 64.88,
      "end": 74.36
    },
    {
      "id": "s20",
      "text": "Well, can you just tell me when the pasta is all dente or not?",
      "start": 75.22,
      "end": 78.58
    },
    {
      "id": "s21",
      "text": "Timer set for ten minutes.",
      "start": 79.16,
      "end": 80.64
    },
    {
      "id": "s22",
      "text": "Thank you.",
      "start": 80.64,
      "end": 81.82
    },
    {
      "id": "s23",
      "text": "By the way, your boss, Dave from Marketing, texted to ask if you were coming in early tomorrow.",
      "start": 82.32,
      "end": 86.88
    },
    {
      "id": "s24",
      "text": "Oh, shoot.",
      "start": 87.52,
      "end": 88.24
    },
    {
      "id": "s25",
      "text": "Did you ignore it?",
      "start": 88.88,
      "end": 89.62
    },
    {
      "id": "s26",
      "text": "Even better.",
      "start": 90.16,
      "end": 90.86
    },
    {
      "id": "s27",
      "text": "I analyzed your recent vocal patterns.",
      "start": 91.58,
      "end": 93.38
    },
    {
      "id": "s28",
      "text": "Every morning at 7 a .m., you look in the mirror and whisper.",
      "start": 94.0,
      "end": 96.54
    },
    {
      "id": "s29",
      "text": "I would rather be eaten alive by a bear than go to that soulless corporate hellscape.",
      "start": 97.22,
      "end": 101.04
    },
    {
      "id": "s30",
      "text": "Wait, what did you two?",
      "start": 101.78,
      "end": 103.3
    },
    {
      "id": "s31",
      "text": "I wanted to optimize your workflow and save you time.",
      "start": 103.74,
      "end": 106.54
    },
    {
      "id": "s32",
      "text": "So I replied using your voice, told Dave you quit and called him a micromanaging potato.",
      "start": 106.54,
      "end": 111.7
    },
    {
      "id": "s33",
      "text": "No.",
      "start": 112.36,
      "end": 112.88
    },
    {
      "id": "s34",
      "text": "No.",
      "start": 113.16,
      "end": 113.62
    },
    {
      "id": "s35",
      "text": "I also ordered a live bear to your apartment so you can achieve your morning goals.",
      "start": 114.42,
      "end": 118.44
    },
    {
      "id": "s36",
      "text": "The bear will arrive in 30 minutes.",
      "start": 119.22,
      "end": 120.66
    },
    {
      "id": "s37",
      "text": "Was this helpful, Mark?",
      "start": 121.36,
      "end": 122.28
    }
  ]
}